From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:01:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] doc/examples/Makefile.example: remove the rule for the
 avcodec example

There is no example called avcodec any more, so the target-specific
LDLIBS setting for it is a leftover.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FZ4G6798n6Ua4qu6xwWu3S
---
 doc/examples/Makefile.example | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/doc/examples/Makefile.example b/doc/examples/Makefile.example
index 498cf43..dee906f 100644
--- a/doc/examples/Makefile.example
+++ b/doc/examples/Makefile.example
@@ -42,7 +42,6 @@ EXAMPLES=\
 OBJS=$(addsuffix .o,$(EXAMPLES))
 
 # the following examples make explicit use of the math library
-avcodec:           LDLIBS += -lm
 encode_audio:      LDLIBS += -lm
 filter_audio:      LDLIBS += -lm
 mux:               LDLIBS += -lm
